# GitHub workflow

This repo lives on GitHub: `git@github.com:itsuppartem/artek-buddy.git` (`origin`, branch `main`).

## After a finished change

1. Bump the one product version (`VERSION`, `src/artek_buddy/__init__.py`, `client/VERSION`).
2. Run `make test`. If it fails, do not commit.
3. Run `.cursor/handoff/check-commit.sh` (local only). If it fails, do not commit.
4. Commit (English, imperative) and push to `origin`.

Do not ask whether to commit or push when the work is a completed project change.

## Do not commit

See `.cursor/rules/precommit-hygiene.mdc`. Short list: `.env`, tokens, `*.deb`, `data/`, `scripts/`, `docs/`. Attribution of the adapted Rakazo contracts stays in `README.md` / `NOTICE` only. Do not present this repo as their TypeScript port.

## Language

Commit messages and repo docs stay English. Chat with the user may stay in their language.
